## System libraries (installed into the Docker image at build time)

apt-installed from the Debian base image; not vendored as source here. Debian
distributes the corresponding source via `apt-get source` / its snapshot archive.

- ffmpeg — GPL-2.0-or-later (Debian build) — https://packages.debian.org/source/stable/ffmpeg
- GStreamer (`gstreamer1.0-*`, `gir1.2-gst*`) — LGPL-2.1 — https://packages.debian.org/source/stable/gstreamer1.0-plugins-base
- flac, libplist, libevent, libcurl, libconfuse — see their respective Debian source packages

## Python dependencies (installed via pip at build time, not vendored)

